<Base title="Contact & Corrections | Litbuy Sheet Lab" description="Find the correct support destination for source catalog corrections, Litbuy orders, warehouse QC and shipping."><main class="long-guide information-page"><h1>Contact and corrections</h1><h2>Catalog information or broken links</h2><p>Each product page links to its FindSpreadsheet source listing. Include the catalog ID, seller item ID and the page URL when reporting a correction through contact details published on the source website. We do not publish an unverified email address or claim to offer live customer support.</p><a class="button-dark" href="https://findspreadsheet.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open FindSpreadsheet</a><h2>Orders, payments, warehouse QC and parcels</h2><p>Contact Litbuy through its official help center or your own account. This site cannot see or change your orders, issue refunds or access your warehouse inspection images.</p><a class="button-dark" href="https://litbuy.com/help" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Litbuy help center</a><h2>What to include</h2><p>Use the relevant product or order identifier and a clear description. Never post passwords, payment-card details or private account credentials on this site.</p></main></Base>
